      "text_preview": "15. At the time of accident the Petitioner was aged about 42 years as could be made out from Ex.P.8/Notarized copy of Aadhar Card."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "48129e438db24afd89acf6c0de6acb92_101",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He was hale and healthy before the accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bad32ec392244751bdbb46f79efd9263_102",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The accident took place in the year 2022."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "591411d3055543388e644cd363f7fec8_103",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Keeping all the above things in mind, Petitioner is entitled to the following compensation:-\n i) PAIN AND SUFFERING:-"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0833b13d88d5483a8013e79699ac5733_104",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "After the accident, the Petitioner was shifted to Hosadurga Primary Health Center and thereafter to Kanakapura Spandana Pvt. Diagnostic Centre and thereafter shifted to Sanjay Gandhi Hospital wherein he was admitted as an inpatient."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "58d1a08c889c471783e484eedf0cb5b6_105",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Considering that the nature of injuries he has undergone are grievous and simple, the Petitioner is awarded a sum of Rs.60,000/- under this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bb474afd603d41bf941f551f84350c8c_106",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nii) MEDICAL EXPENSES:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9478bc7976f14b47ab8b146ac406bdbb_107",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThe Petitioner has pleaded that he has spent a sum of huge amount towards treatment, medicines,\nconveyance, food and nourishment and other incidental expenses etc."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "48766ca301c447f2b33a1fce38a46f3e_108",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In this regard, the petitioner has produced medical bills for Rs.2,928/- as per Ex.P.9."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eb16b68187734fc58d593c1b39c82a1d_109",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There is no contrary evidence produced by the Respondent."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1eaac0a4ba3648bab2dde4889b618b49_110",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the petitioner is entitled for the said amount under this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cd52dab9058140bbaf20f30f72a2e60e_111",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\niii) LOSS OF INCOME DURING LAID UP PERIOD:-\nAs mentioned above the petitioner has sustained grievous injuries."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "63fa8417f4754946bde253278bd8785d_112",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In this regard petitioner has not produced discharge summary of any hospitals wherein the petitioner was treated as an inpatient."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "56b91fe0d6084c0ea88fa43a6bb451df_113",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, considering the nature of injuries it can be said that the Petitioner may have required at least one month time for recovering from the injuries suffered by him."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c7277cd2abed4e3d97a212aba96a1cb5_114",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, he is entitled only for a sum of Rs.15,500/- under this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ab8632b77a694d49b4217d640b31b7c2_115",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\niv) LOSS OF FUTURE INCOME:-\nRamesh Naika vs Sbi General Ins Co Ltd on 10 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/67497805/\n5"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a312c86ba3754b48ad5712f0ba973d11_116",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On perusal of Ex.P.8, the date of birth of the petitioner is 01.01.1980 and the date of accident is 21.12.2022."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9b272b4328734b9f8feb60f474eae96d_117",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, as on the date of the accident the Petitioner's age is 42 years."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8bc3f56a69114c439d4cc91c4765a4ec_118",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the dictum laid down in Sarala Verma's case, above 42 years the appropriate multiplier applicable to his age is 14."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "43a08310102c4bcabcc62e7a9b1731c9_119",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As such the petitioner is entitled to Rs.2,51,546/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "df0e0e4e07144bd8a6e6c22af15c7322_120",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "(Rs.15,500/- x 12 x 9.66% x 14 = Rs.2,51,546/- )."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ad89d36334f04cb9bbf61959ef5e0766_121",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n (v) LOSS OF FUTURE AMENITIES AND  HAPPINESS:-\nThe Petitioner was aged about 42 years at the time of accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b26597b28ef547f59793a55394a61f91_122",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He has sustained grievous injuries and as per consideration of this Tribunal, he is suffering from 9.66% functional disability."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "883280a6535f45cfbe6e0fd5d8c5e6ee_123",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Petitioner has to suffer this disability throughout his life."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5bb4dfa8818d4e0ab1eb3c8606877e73_124",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Because of this he will have to lose some of the amenities and comforts."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e435197beb534d5bbb3e5a1b2aa550d5_125",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, considering the age and nature of injuries that the Petitioner has suffered, a sum of Rs.20,000/- is awarded under this head."
    },
